<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      /* Basic reset */
      body,
      html {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f7f7f7;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 5px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        color: #333;
        padding-bottom: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 20px 0;
        color: #555;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .otp-box {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        background-color: #6BA83C; /* Warna Ku */
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 24px;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer {
        padding-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h2>Verifikasi Email</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Halo,</p>
        <p>Gunakan kode OTP berikut untuk memverifikasi alamat email Anda:</p>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <div class="otp-box"><%= otp %></div>
        </div>

        <p>Jika Anda tidak meminta kode ini, silakan abaikan email ini.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> 
          <strong style="color: #2B959F;">Ternak</strong><strong style="color: #6BA83C;">Ku</strong>. 
          Hak Cipta Dilindungi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>